@startuml
hide empty description
state "Backlog" as Backlog
state "To Do" as Todo
state "In Progress" as Progress
state "In Review" as Review
state "Done" as Done
state "Archived" as Archived
state "Blocked" as Blocked
[*] --> Backlog
Backlog --> Todo : Admin or Manager / assigned user
Todo --> Progress : Allowed role / assigned user / fewer than 5 active
Progress --> Todo : Assigned user
Progress --> Review : Manager or Admin / assigned user
Review --> Done : Manager or Admin / assigned user
Done --> Todo : Admin / assigned user / special Return action
Done --> Archived : Automatic archive
Archived --> Todo : Admin / assigned user / special Return action
[*] <-- Archived
Backlog --> Blocked : Admin / assigned user
Todo --> Blocked : Admin / assigned user
Progress --> Blocked : Admin / assigned user
Review --> Blocked : Admin / assigned user
note right of Blocked
  Manual exit is forbidden.
  Cross-project drag-and-drop is forbidden.
  Every manual drag-and-drop also requires task assignment.
end note
@enduml
